error[O-Escapes]: this boundary carries an observation from an owner its signature does not permit
  --> tests/borrows/contracts/a_clause_written_in_place_of_an_inferred_one_keeps_its_sources.lin:12:13
   |
12 |             self.name.view()
   |             ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ escape observations only from the signature's declared sources
   |
   = help: the value comes from `self`; write `where borrows(self), carries(other)` to say so
   = help: an owned copy observes nothing and needs no clause: declare the result `Result[String[mem.SystemAllocator], mem.Oom]` and return `….to_owned()`, which copies the text and can fail with `mem.Oom`
